WEBVTT

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.740
That's right.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.920
Miyu, you don't need to be bound 
by that man any longer.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.220
N-No way. Why are you...

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.530
What's happening?

00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:28.270
It can't be.

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.590
I heard what's going on.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.180
Thank you.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.370
For fighting for my little sister.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.240
I'll take care of the rest.

00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:40.650
That's my job, as her big brother.

00:00:43.870 --> 00:00:45.050
<i>Trace...</i>

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:47.700
<i>On.</i>

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.110
That's...

00:00:58.700 --> 00:00:59.770
Julian!

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:06.380
It seems Miyu will never find 
happiness unless I defeat you.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.840
If you say you'll sacrifice one for the whole,

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:13.550
I'll be the villain as often as it takes.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:16.850
Are you ready, hero of justice?

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.310
Emiya Shirou...

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:54.020
<b>Episode 11 
You Are Not Alone</b>

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:55.770
Emiya?

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.060
Shirou?

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.010
Emiya-kun?

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:00.850
Shero?

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.140
Onii-chan!

00:03:07.110 --> 00:03:08.040
<i>Trace...</i>

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:09.360
<i>on!</i>

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:18.710
O-Onii-cha—

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.030
<i>No...</i>

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:26.600
<i>That's...</i>

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:29.730
Miyu,

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.750
sorry I couldn't protect you.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.730
But this time...

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.490
I'm going to end this.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:46.480
I won't let you pass.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:48.910
Odd how our positions are 
reversed from last time.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:51.830
Quit prattling, Faker.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.710
Same to you, Counterfeiter!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.970
You should already know better.

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.970
You can't keep up with me that way.

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:11.360
<i>She's right...</i>

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.400
<i>Trace on.</i>

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:22.820
<i>Sword barrel...</i>

00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.100
<i>Full open!</i>

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.510
<i>Yeah, I do know.</i>

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.570
<i>You're probably thinking,</i>

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:37.150
<i>"Use it one more time.</i>

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.940
<i>Destroy yourself."</i>

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.570
There is no escape for you.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:42.850
No...

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:46.240
There was never any place for you to go.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.130
I'm already risking my life.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:52.360
I've long since decided how to spend it.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:55.110
<i>I am the bone of my sword.</i>

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:02.160
<i>Steel is my body, and fire is my blood.</i>

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:08.040
<i>I have created over a thousand blades.</i>

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:13.230
<i>Unaware of beginning,</i>

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.940
<i>Nor aware of the end—</i>

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.870
You can't even activate it anymore?

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:30.040
Then there's nothing left to see here.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:31.370
Get off the stage.

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:33.600
Your role is over.

00:05:34.260 --> 00:05:37.530
This time, I will eliminate your very existence.

00:05:38.180 --> 00:05:39.620
Stage?

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:41.870
Role?

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:46.290
I'm sick of playing house with you people.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:50.370
Out of my way, third-rate actor.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.210
<i>My objective hasn't changed.</i>

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:56.830
<i>There was only one thing I could ever do, anyway.</i>

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:59.290
<i>Ignore everything that isn't fatal.</i>

00:05:59.980 --> 00:06:02.420
<i>Take down as many Noble Phantasms as possible.</i>

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:04.210
<i>Advance one more step!</i>

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:07.050
You won't reach us.

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:10.010
<i>I can't die here!</i>

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.180
You aren't fast enough.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:13.520
<i>If I die here,</i>

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.640
<i>who will protect Miyu?</i>

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.150
You're...

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:26.400
Between Miyu and your projection thaumaturgy,

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.710
I have a ton of questions for you.

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:30.950
But right now, I'll lend you a hand,

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.460
Onii-chan.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.460
<i>I see.</i>

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:48.170
<i>So that's why, back then, Miyu...</i>

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:53.490
<i>I don't know what you things are,</i>

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.890
<i>but don't interrupt us right now!</i>

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.940
This is a dead end for you!

00:07:03.690 --> 00:07:05.690
The flow of force has changed direction.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.380
You two should retreat now, while you can.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:10.380
What nonsense are you muttering?

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:12.740
I'm out of jewels,

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.510
they took over my mind,

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:17.680
and now, someone who looks 
exactly like that oaf shows up.

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:21.320
Frankly, my mind can't keep up with any of this.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:23.320
Yes, indeed.

00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:26.880
However, those children are still fighting.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:30.010
So we adults can't abandon them...

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.160
...and run away.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:32.620
So we have no choice.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.430
<i>Ah, I see.</i>

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:38.100
<i>You're not</i>

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.480
<i>alone anymore, Miyu.</i>

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.540
Miyu!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:44.860
I'll cover you.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.520
I'm fighting, too.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.630
I can fight,

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:49.820
as long as we're all together!

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:52.780
She's not alone,

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:56.490
and she's not some princess that 
needs protection, either.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:08:01.200
Well, crap... I'm losing some of 
my dignity as a big brother.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:05.260
But well, first...

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:06.920
Yes, first...

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.420
We have to take out this small fry.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:13.280
Repulsive.

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:14.760
Two fakers?

00:08:15.150 --> 00:08:17.330
It makes me sick to my stomach.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:23.550
That thaumaturgy is nothing but 
an insult to the Ainsworths.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.370
What is that?

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:28.210
She's connecting the space above and below,

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:30.860
accelerating her Noble Phantasms?

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:35.240
<i>They're too fast!</i>

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.130
<i>Intercepting them will be...</i>

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.070
<i>...impossible!</i>

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:43.370
What one-track minds.

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.610
<i>Sharpen your senses to their limits,</i>

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:46.680
<i>read through her,</i>

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:48.850
<i>and seize, with your own hands,</i>

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.300
<i>your survival five seconds from now!</i>

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.850
<i>Every single blade is lethal,</i>

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.100
<i>prohibiting defense and evasion</i>

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:07.160
<i>in this Heroic Spirit's perfect attack.</i>

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:10.610
<i>And now, double that!</i>

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:13.900
<i>So, without fail...</i>

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.030
It's futile.

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:20.340
Die.

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:24.870
<i>So, without fail, you'll rely on 
your most trusted defense.</i>

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.220
<i>Where's the other one?</i>

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:35.330
<i>From outside my conscious spatial displacement?</i>

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:39.810
<i>That's right. She's that teleportation user.</i>

00:09:40.310 --> 00:09:41.210
<i>It's strange.</i>

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:46.750
<i>Why do I understand how to use 
this power when I watch him?</i>

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.950
I've seen enough of your Noble Phantasms.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.940
Let us pass,

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.440
King of Heroes!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.940
Faker...

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.380
I've made it to you, Julian!

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.470
<i>There's no more need for words.</i>

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.480
<i>I'm abandoning this world for my little sister.</i>

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:24.090
<i>If you would call that evil, then...</i>

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:31.680
That's no good, Senpai.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:34.910
<i>Who are</i>

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:38.290
<i>you?</i>

00:10:44.430 --> 00:10:45.360
Miyu!

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:49.250
<i>Class Card, Archer... Install!</i>

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:52.510
W-Wait, Miyu-sama!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.870
It knocked me away?

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.340
Something's wrong with that Card!

00:10:59.270 --> 00:11:01.130
That's mean, Senpai.

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:06.560
I'm the only one you're allowed 
to kill or be killed by.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:09.540
That can't be...

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.350
You're already...

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:17.280
Get away from Onii-chan!

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:24.480
Onii-chan!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.470
Run!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:30.320
She's...

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:34.130
Why is some woman I don't 
recognize interrupting me

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:37.650
when I'm talking to my senpai?

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:42.070
No way.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.800
You are becoming an eyesore,

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:49.710
Emiya Shirou.

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:50.850
Kick him out.

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.350
Yes, Julian-sama!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.150
Onii-chan!

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.000
Onii-chan!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.300
This is bad! He's going to fall!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:00.460
I'll go!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:05.200
Don't go near my Julian-sama!

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:07.640
The sword's falling!

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:09.900
What the heck?

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:11.390
It's hollow?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.320
Kuro!

00:12:13.320 --> 00:12:15.460
Worry about Onii-chan before me!

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:19.190
<i>Es ist groß.</i>

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.940
<i>Es ist klein.</i>

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.100
Rin-san!

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:33.530
Tenacious.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:34.870
Why, you...

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.520
You'd let me fall with them?

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:43.010
Well, no one told me to rescue you.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.360
Later.

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:54.960
What are you...

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.810
I'll have to punish Senpai later.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.400
The only one who can understand Senpai,

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.970
the only one who can love Senpai,

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:11.750
the only one who can kill Senpai...

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.860
is me.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.730
<i>She's completely broken.</i>

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.540
<i>Talking is pointless.</i>

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:22.360
<i>She's not someone I can fight 
while running away.</i>

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:23.900
<i>So...</i>

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:26.850
Well, then, I have no choice.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:28.660
I will break you,

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:29.910
doll.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:32.740
Rin-san!

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:33.960
How's Onii-chan?

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:37.210
I can't exactly say he's all right.

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.010
<i>His wounds are too deep.</i>

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:41.940
<i>It's a wonder he hasn't died of shock.</i>

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.570
Ah, jeez!

00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:47.180
And I'm bad at healing magic!

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.890
I'll try to keep him alive.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.360
Buy me some time!

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:51.270
Right.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:52.730
But still...

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.820
We won't last a minute against this.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.310
Miyu-sama!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:13:59.970
That Card is dangerous.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:01.450
Hurry and release it!

00:14:04.390 --> 00:14:08.020
Well, this is a fairly interesting vessel.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.550
<i>What is this?</i>

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:13.170
<i>My mouth and body are moving on their own?</i>

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:19.110
You have astounded me, curs.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:23.000
You will pay with your lives for 
the outrages and barbarism

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:27.060
that you've enacted upon a king like me.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.090
That's your limit.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.140
Even after passing through 
the Box, the Heroic Spirit

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.730
had an ego that wasn't thoroughly corrupted.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:38.730
It was an excellent pawn, but it can't be helped.

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:44.100
I'll dispose of this Card before it 
completely eats away your mind.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:47.740
You damned cur!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.100
A chain?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.730
It's really pathetic, isn't it?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:15:00.250
Losing to a faker, getting used by others...

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:04.670
But you've had enough fun now, haven't you?

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:08.010
Welcome home, my other half.

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:17.040
To be honest, I don't really care 
about what you're trying to do.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:20.020
But I'm a little angry.

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:23.070
Too many irregularities occur 
when he joins the fray.

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:26.150
Before he uses that Card,

00:15:26.590 --> 00:15:27.580
kill him.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.490
Yes, Julian-sama!

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:36.630
Are you all right, Miyu-sama?

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.710
It's dangerous here.

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:40.320
Enter Trance and escape.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:40.960
Yeah.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:44.990
You're going to see Senpai, aren't you?

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:48.710
As if I would let you do that.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.140
Do you think Senpai will compliment me?

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:57.770
Believe it or not, I'm very good

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.490
at exterminating pests.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.400
<i>Shadow Hand of Code.</i>

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:10.370
Who is that?

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:13.320
If you interrupt my cleaning, I'll ki—

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.570
That's my little sister.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:19.710
Oh, I see!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:23.900
There's no club today, 
so you're going home, right?

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:26.710
Yes, I am.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:29.670
Well, see you tomorrow, then.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.510
Yes. Goodbye, Senpai.

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.310
See you tomorrow.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:41.390
Julian...

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:46.720
Oh? So that's how you're manipulating her.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:49.500
What's with these chains?!

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:50.860
I can't get them off!

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:53.330
I don't get it, though.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:56.440
Your wish is for humanity's salvation, right?

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:59.580
But right now, you seem to be 
working for the opposite.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:01.710
Your wish—

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.520
Don't get in Onii-chan's way, Gilgamesh.

00:17:05.850 --> 00:17:09.250
I don't understand complicated things anymore,

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:12.930
but Onii-chan's going to save everyone.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:18.200
So I don't have to think about anything.

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:22.480
I just need to do my best to open the pithos!

00:17:25.070 --> 00:17:26.330
You...

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:28.460
So that's it?

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.870
I can't believe it!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:47.550
So that's your crux!

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:49.720
My goodness,

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:53.070
what a pitiful dead end you've created.

00:17:57.430 --> 00:17:59.750
Woman, you are indeed

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.140
the mud doll of calamity.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:07.020
<i>What are these things?</i>

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:09.910
<i>No matter how many we defeat, 
there's no end to them.</i>

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:17.970
He's huge!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.900
I'll shoot him.

00:18:19.900 --> 00:18:21.120
Pin him down!

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:21.920
Okay!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.420
Take this!

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.960
Even with Saber's power, parrying his 
attacks takes everything I have!

00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:34.540
These things...

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:36.680
Kuro!

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:41.550
Illya!

00:18:53.160 --> 00:18:55.610
A-Are you all right, Illya-san?

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.030
Y-Yeah...

00:18:57.140 --> 00:18:58.050
Illya!

00:18:58.480 --> 00:18:59.840
I'm okay...

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:04.690
Keep healing Oni... Shirou-san!

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:05.540
Yeah.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.480
This barricade will barely keep them out!

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:09.040
Aren't you done yet, Rin?

00:19:09.380 --> 00:19:11.160
I'm giving it everything I have!

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:15.250
But right now, I'm just barely 
keeping him from bleeding out.

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:18.430
If we move him, there's no guarantee he'll live.

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:21.620
Not until I reconnect his veins, at least.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.670
No way...

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:29.430
You keep picking on us.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.610
Are you a damn mother-in-law?!

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:36.070
I'd rather not fight you outdoors.

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:37.510
Hey!

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:41.080
I want to watch you struggle until the end.

00:19:41.460 --> 00:19:43.320
Dance to your heart's content,

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.290
and keep me entertained.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.140
Though, I know how this will end.

00:19:48.440 --> 00:19:52.840
Well, I'll leave some advice
for you, you poor thing.

00:20:00.740 --> 00:20:02.340
Illya! Kuro!

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:08.140
Huh?

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:11.180
What's going on?

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.760
This is bad!

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:16.320
The enemy's started using Noble Phantasms!

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:22.710
Illya, take Kuro and run.

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:24.070
Huh?

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:28.090
My weak healing magic will take too long!

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:31.080
If we keep this up, we'll all die!

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:34.690
I'm sorry to force you to make a hard choice.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:36.860
But there's no time to hesitate.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:37.780
Hurry!

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:43.750
Kuro!

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:57.030
Rin-san, go back to healing him.

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:59.640
Were you listening to me?

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:14.500
I'll keep healing him.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:18.540
Blow this adversity away!

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:23.600
<i>I've already made my choice.</i>

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:28.650
<i>I'm going to save both Miyu and the world.</i>

00:21:30.840 --> 00:21:33.350
<i>So I won't run.</i>

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:35.590
<i>I won't</i>

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:39.160
<i>give up on anything anymore!</i>

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:49.630
<i>Excalibur!</i>

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:25.920
I won't run.

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:31.350
The future always

00:23:32.390 --> 00:23:33.860
lies ahead!

00:23:32.410 --> 00:26:00.000
<b>Next Time 
Woven Miracles</b>
